  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transition to self-reliance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is that refugees in Oruchinga, Nakivale, Bidi bidi and Lobule refugee settlements and their host communities are able to meet their food security, nutrition and other associated needs in a sustainable manner.</narrative>
  </description>
